    "保存失败 · 修改已保留": "Save failed · Changes retained", "该条审查已被其他窗口修改。你的笔记仍保留在此，请复制笔记后重新载入，合并后再保存。": "This review was modified in another window. Your notes remain here. Copy them before reloading, merge the changes and save again.",
    "选中 AVL 原始位置；未关联 APC": "Selected source AVL location; not associated with APC", "此窗口无可用地理坐标": "No usable geographic coordinates in this window",
    "横向浏览全天": "Browse the full day horizontally", "横向浏览加载范围": "Browse the loaded time range", "时间窗长度必须是正数，可用秒或分钟。": "Window length must be positive, in seconds or minutes.",
    "此窗口无实际 GPS，不补出车辆位置": "No observed GPS in this window; vehicle positions are not fabricated", "此窗口无可用实测累计距离 · 不外推 APC 进度": "No usable observed cumulative distance in this window · APC progress is not extrapolated",
    "MATCHED · 算法择定": "MATCHED · Algorithm-selected", "AMBIGUOUS · 多候选": "AMBIGUOUS · Multiple candidates", "PATTERN_ONLY · 仅线路模式": "PATTERN_ONLY · Pattern only", "UNMATCHED · 无可接受候选": "UNMATCHED · No acceptable candidate", "BOUNDARY_UNCERTAIN · 边界待定": "BOUNDARY_UNCERTAIN · Boundary uncertain",
    "Pattern 支持分（非概率）": "Pattern support score (not a probability)", "Trip 支持分（非概率）": "Trip support score (not a probability)", "Top1–Top2 支持分差": "Top1–Top2 support-score margin", "模型时移估计 / 秒": "Estimated model time shift / seconds", "支持窗口数（重叠不可相加）": "Supporting windows (overlaps cannot be added)",
    "未过门槛 · 仅供排查，不计入最终候选、状态或概率": "Below threshold · Diagnostic only; excluded from final candidates, status and probability",
    "成本门通过（仍为候选，非已验证 trip）": "Cost gate passed (still a candidate, not a verified trip)", "近等价竞争者（超成本门，保留用于歧义检查）": "Near-equivalent competitor (above cost gate; retained for ambiguity checks)",
    "此处仅为最终评分中的绝对时间偏移项；同一权重也参与延误拟合及边界模型。": "This is only the absolute time-shift term in the final score. The same weight also affects delay fitting and the boundary model.",
    "未返回具体拒判门槛；不得据此视为通过。": "No specific rejection gates were returned; this must not be interpreted as a pass.", "查看此参考轴": "View this reference axis", "候选来源、时间窗与评分组成": "Candidate provenance, time windows and score components",
    "此方向候选没有最终 GTFS trip 候选。下方未过门槛候选只用于对比排查，不改变本次拒判结果。": "This direction candidate has no final GTFS trip candidate. Below-threshold candidates below are for diagnostic comparison only and do not change this abstention.",
    "没有额外可展示的已评分、未过门槛候选。": "No additional scored, below-threshold candidates are available.", "此版本没有提供额外诊断候选；未改变原结果。": "This version provides no additional diagnostic candidates; original results are unchanged.",
    "只叠加同一 reference_id；更换候选不会把不同参考轴的 s 混为一体。": "Only the same reference_id is overlaid; switching candidates never mixes s coordinates from different reference axes.",
    "原始来源按跨尺度权重归一，重叠窗口不可独立重复计证据": "Source weights are normalized across scales; overlapping windows are not independent repeated evidence",
